@startuml bridge_stream_class
title Stream abstractions + konkretne backendy

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

abstract class Stream {
  + Read(buffer, offset, count) : int
  + Write(buffer, offset, count)
  + Seek(offset, origin) : long
  + Flush()
  + Close()
  + CanRead : bool
  + CanWrite : bool
  + CanSeek : bool
}

class FileStream {
  - _handle : SafeFileHandle
}

class MemoryStream {
  - _buffer : byte[]
}

class NetworkStream {
  - _socket : Socket
}

class GZipStream {
  - _innerStream : Stream
}

class BufferedStream {
  - _innerStream : Stream
  - _buffer : byte[]
}

Stream <|-- FileStream
Stream <|-- MemoryStream
Stream <|-- NetworkStream
Stream <|-- GZipStream
Stream <|-- BufferedStream

GZipStream o--> Stream : deleguje do
BufferedStream o--> Stream : deleguje do

note bottom of GZipStream
  Most + Dekorator:
  owijanie dowolnego backendu
  kompresja przezroczysta
end note

@enduml
